step Expert Enchanting
  zone Azeroth
  tip Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Enchanting 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Kitta Firewind (Elwynn Forest); Horde Hgarth (Stonetalon Mountains). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Runed Golden Rod (from 150). 150-225 takes 1 Iridescent Pearl, 1 Black Pearl, 1 Greater Astral Essence, 71 Soul Dust, 1 Golden Rod, 1 Greater Mystic Essence, 21 Vision Dust and 1 Truesilver Rod to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility (from 160), Runed Truesilver Rod (from 200) and Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense (from 205), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3.
  level 20
  train Enchanting Expert
  learn 13628

step Enchant Bracer - Lesser Stamina to 160
  tip Enchant Bracer - Lesser Stamina is orange at 150 (yellow 155, green 175, grey 195): about 11 crafts to 160. Each takes 1 Soul Dust. One Soul Dust a craft (level 21-30 greens). Make the Runed Golden Rod now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. Greater Astral Essence (1 for 150-225): Enchanting: disenchant green items of item level 16-25; or the Auction House. Soul Dust (71 for 150-225): Enchanting: disenchant green items of item level 21-30; or the Auction House. Golden Rod (1 for 150-225): Blacksmithing: Golden Rod; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one.
  craft 13628 x1 -- a tool: keep it in your bags
  craft 13501 until 160

step Enchanting recipes at 160
  tip Still at the Expert trainer: Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility (from 160).
  learn 13637

step Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility to 205
  tip Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility is orange at 160 (yellow 180, green 200, grey 220): about 59 crafts to 205. Each takes 1 Soul Dust. Soul Dust again. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one.
  craft 13637 until 205

step Enchanting recipes at 205
  tip Still at the Expert trainer: Runed Truesilver Rod (from 200) and Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense (from 205).
  learn 13702
  learn 13746

step Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense to 225
  tip Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 245, grey 265): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 1 Vision Dust. One Vision Dust a craft (level 31-40 greens). Make the Runed Truesilver Rod first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. Black Pearl (1 for 150-225): Black Pearl is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find. Greater Mystic Essence (1 for 150-225): Enchanting: disenchant green items of item level 26-35; or the Auction House. Vision Dust (21 for 150-225): Enchanting: disenchant green items of item level 31-40; or the Auction House. Truesilver Rod (1 for 150-225): Blacksmithing: Truesilver Rod; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. Enchanting 225 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 13702 x1 -- a tool: keep it in your bags
  craft 13746 until 225
  skill Enchanting 225

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan (225-300)

step Artisan Enchanting
  tip Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 5g (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Enchanting 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Annora teaches Artisan Enchanting inside the Uldaman dungeon (Badlands); bring a group. Learn now: Enchant Gloves - Agility (from 210). 225-300 takes about 2g 20s of recipes and 1g 70s of vendor goods, plus 34 Purple Lotus, 39 Vision Dust and 208 Dream Dust to gather or buy.
  level 35
  train 11073
  learn 13815 npc 11073

step Enchanting 225-300: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 34 Crystal Vial (1g 70s); about 1g 70s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Edna Mullby, Eldraeith and Jasper Fel; Orgrimmar: Felika, Kor'geld and Rekkul).
  buy 8925 x34 nearest

step Formula: Lesser Mana Oil
  tip Formula: Lesser Mana Oil teaches Lesser Mana Oil (Enchanting 250) for 1g. Sold by Kania (Silithus).
  buy 20754 nearest

step Formula: Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina
  tip Formula: Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina teaches Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina (Enchanting 265) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: Mythrin'dir (Darnassus), limited stock; Horde: Daniel Bartlett (Undercity), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it.
  buy 16217 nearest

step Purple Lotus (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip 34 Purple Lotus for Lesser Mana Oil: Herbalism: Purple Lotus (skill 210) in The Hinterlands (40-50), Feralas (40-50) and Azshara (45-55); or the Auction House. The densest patch of Purple Lotus in The Hinterlands is marked.
  collect 8831 x34 @66.3,71.6 era

